  "notes": "Not an upstream vLLM release. The image is ghcr.io/miaai-lab/mia-vllm-gb10-linear-b12x, published by https://github.com/MiaAI-Lab/Unsloth-Qwen3.6-35b-NVFP4-DGX-Spark and built on timothystewart6/vllm-gb10 (ARM64 / SM121, CUDA 13, FlashInfer 0.6.14). pip reports 0.26.1.dev0+gf2654939e.d20260726, i.e. upstream commit f2654939e plus the fork's patches. Its distinguishing flag is --linear-backend flashinfer_b12x, an NVFP4 GEMM path with a soft fallback to auto for layers that are not NVFP4; the recipe carries that fallback as docker/patch_linear_backend_soft_fallback.py. The README describes the base stack as 'vLLM ~0.26', which is close but not a version string a result can be keyed on, so this file records what the running build reports about itself.",
